  "result": "I fixed the cross-organization leak. The cause was that `findIssueById` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts:58` looked an issue up by its id alone and never filtered by organization. So an id from any customer's organization returned that customer's issue row.\n\nThe function now adds the organization check (`orgPredicate(issues.orgId, orgId)`) to the query, like the other functions in that file. An issue id from another organization now finds no row, and the issue service turns that into a normal \"not found\" response, as if the issue doesn't exist.\n\nThis one lookup is used by the issue, comment, attachment, search and notification services, so all of those are covered by the same change. The issue repository, tenant-scope and service tests pass (77 tests).",
